  "body_text": "第一天结束了\n吃好饭\n坐下来再感受下今天一天\n开心，也感谢\n给展位前打翻咖啡弄脏衣服的那位女生致歉\n给那一阵子在展位前经过，但无法招呼到或者没有说上几句话的朋友们致歉\n今天临时调整做了一次杯测，但效果不理想\n明天(13号）上午11:30\n我们再做一次杯测\n这可能是本次展会的最后一次杯测哦\n希望能有更多的人来参与\n我们的位置在 👉\n广州保利世贸博览馆\n8 号馆\n(H8)\nG3 - 11 展位\n3F中间的展馆\n主角是五只不同的Papua New Guinea & 哥伦比亚（4只）& 埃塞 （2只）\nPNG Eastern Highlands\nMorita\n,\n庄园自有种植，\nArusha 单一品种\n反文化2018年送交基因检测，结果是\nArusha与Kenya的K7基因一致\nPNG Eastern Highlands\nBaroida\n, Bourbon/Typica/Mundo Novo/Arusha，\n庄园自己种植，采收\n，处理，脱壳\nPNG Eastern Highlands\nKobuta\n, Bourbon/Typica/Mundo Novo/Arusha混合种，\n庄园从小农收购鲜果\n来处理，脱壳\nPNG Eastern Highlands\nBoka\n，Bourbon/Typica/Mundo Novo/Arusha混合种， 庄园从小农采购，分选出的\n单一小农批次\n，处理，脱壳\nPNG Eastern Highlands\nTairora\n, Bourbon/Typica/Mundo Novo/Arusha混合种，\n庄园从小农收购鲜果\n来处理，脱壳\nColombia El Paraiso Red Plum Profile Designed，天堂的红布林批次\nColombia Huila Pink Bourbon Washed, 粉波水洗\nColombia Huila Pink Bourbon Natural, 粉波日晒\nColombia 大嘴鸟庄园 厌氧日晒，类似于哥斯达黎加音乐家的酒香脚感风味调性\nEthiopia, 埃塞杯（以前叫红樱桃项目OCR）竞拍批次12A， 水洗耶加，属于Gotiti区域下，非常经典的水洗耶加柑橘调，细腻\nEthiopia, 埃塞杯（以前叫红樱桃项目OCR）竞拍批次19C, 日晒耶加，属于Chelchele区域下，非常经典（讲真）的日晒耶加自然熟果果香，不似今年的Aricha厌氧那么热带水果番石榴，更似柑橘，蓝莓，桃子，苹果之类的熟果果香，酸转甜显著，细腻\n欢迎大家来现场 Hell Yeah!!\n没有门票的童鞋，可以扫描下面二维码申请门票\n刚测试过，还是可以用的\n填写名字和手机号后，会返回下面的样子\nCOFFEE IS\nBE\nGOOD TO PEOPLE.\n- 完 -",
  "body_html": "<div class=\"rich_media_content js_underline_content\" id=\"js_content\" style=\"visibility: hidden; opacity: 0; \">\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          第一天结束了\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          吃好饭\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          坐下来再感受下今天一天\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          开心，也感谢\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          给展位前打翻咖啡弄脏衣服的那位女生致歉\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          给那一阵子在展位前经过，但无法招呼到或者没有说上几句话的朋友们致歉\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n89oFxpl2mNyRNaPchzbnoCy5ias8PnbpicDbZp3iaS4vvLZkf9CXYTM0UFbGEua3VBCb15HNOmgagtQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          今天临时调整做了一次杯测，但效果不理想\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;font-size: 14px;\">\n            明天(13号）上午11:30\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我们再做一次杯测\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          这可能是本次展会的最后一次杯测哦\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          希望能有更多的人来参与\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          我们的位置在 👉\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);\">\n<strong>\n            广州保利世贸博览馆\n           </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);text-decoration: none;\">\n<strong>\n            8 号馆\n           </strong>\n<strong>\n            (H8)\n           </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"color: rgb(255, 76, 0);text-decoration: none;font-size: 14px;\">\n<strong>\n<strong style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 76, 0);color: rgb(255, 76, 0);font-size: 14px;text-align: center;white-space: normal;\">\n            G3 - 11 展位\n           </strong>\n</strong>\n<strong>\n<strong style=\"caret-color: rgb(255, 76, 0);color: rgb(255, 76, 0);font-size: 14px;text-align: center;white-space: normal;\">\n</strong>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          3F中间的展馆\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"white-space: normal;text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          主角是五只不同的Papua New Guinea &amp; 哥伦比亚（4只）&amp; 埃塞 （2只）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<ul class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type: circle;\">\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            PNG Eastern Highlands\n            <strong>\n<em>\n              Morita\n             </em>\n</strong>\n            ,\n            <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n              庄园自有种植，\n             </strong>\n<strong>\n              Arusha 单一品种\n             </strong>\n</span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            反文化2018年送交基因检测，结果是\n           </span>\n<a data-linktype=\"2\" href=\"https://counterculturecoffee.com/blog/what-is-coffee-dna-testing-and-how-does-it-help-farmers\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\" target=\"_blank\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n             Arusha与Kenya的K7基因一致\n            </span>\n</a>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            PNG Eastern Highlands\n            <strong>\n<em>\n              Baroida\n             </em>\n</strong>\n            , Bourbon/Typica/Mundo Novo/Arusha，\n            <span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n              庄园自己种植，采收\n             </strong>\n</span>\n            ，处理，脱壳\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            PNG Eastern Highlands\n            <strong>\n<em>\n              Kobuta\n             </em>\n</strong>\n            , Bourbon/Typica/Mundo Novo/Arusha混合种，\n            <strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n              庄园从小农收购鲜果\n             </span>\n</strong>\n            来处理，脱壳\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            PNG Eastern Highlands\n            <strong>\n<em>\n              Boka\n             </em>\n</strong>\n            ，Bourbon/Typica/Mundo Novo/Arusha混合种， 庄园从小农采购，分选出的\n           </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-decoration: underline;\">\n<strong>\n             单一小农批次\n            </strong>\n</span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            ，处理，脱壳\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            PNG Eastern Highlands\n            <strong>\n<em>\n              Tairora\n             </em>\n</strong>\n            , Bourbon/Typica/Mundo Novo/Arusha混合种，\n            <strong>\n<span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">\n              庄园从小农收购鲜果\n             </span>\n</strong>\n            来处理，脱壳\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Colombia El Paraiso Red Plum Profile Designed，天堂的红布林批次\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Colombia Huila Pink Bourbon Washed, 粉波水洗\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Colombia Huila Pink Bourbon Natural, 粉波日晒\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Colombia 大嘴鸟庄园 厌氧日晒，类似于哥斯达黎加音乐家的酒香脚感风味调性\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Ethiopia, 埃塞杯（以前叫红樱桃项目OCR）竞拍批次12A， 水洗耶加，属于Gotiti区域下，非常经典的水洗耶加柑橘调，细腻\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n<li>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n            Ethiopia, 埃塞杯（以前叫红樱桃项目OCR）竞拍批次19C, 日晒耶加，属于Chelchele区域下，非常经典（讲真）的日晒耶加自然熟果果香，不似今年的Aricha厌氧那么热带水果番石榴，更似柑橘，蓝莓，桃子，苹果之类的熟果果香，酸转甜显著，细腻\n           </span>\n</section>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          欢迎大家来现场 Hell Yeah!!\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          没有门票的童鞋，可以扫描下面二维码申请门票\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          刚测试过，还是可以用的\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/j67J43ibr4n89oFxpl2mNyRNaPchzbnoC7Fo1KJqR20tB3wHtj7w4hwkI2qBmZVsPk34KolsZdvbwHOg3SfOFRg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          填写名字和手机号后，会返回下面的样子\n          <br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n89oFxpl2mNyRNaPchzbnoCxwRrgR9uXqQ7jnjiaZKdsldF8FdNwmXM8tmYicWbg4AqJiaBfTAnRXlag/640?wx_fmt=png\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          COFFEE IS\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<em>\n           BE\n          </em>\n          GOOD TO PEOPLE.\n         </span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          - 完 -\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/j67J43ibr4n8Y9vYibh11kLP9LaJ3XvF2pkFCWzVzI6xDXrl8yfFrSGkGibj50Kf8OdW1phgBq9smic9TQx